  "description": "A-LANE ENERGY – NO-NONSENSE E-BIKE FOR THE CITY\n\nThe SPARTA a-LANE ENERGY is designed for those looking for a reliable city bike with excellent value. The Bosch BES3 smart system and Purion 200 display provide easy access to various pedal assist levels and ride data, ideal for commuting.\n\nThe sturdy construction, wide tires, and suspension fork ensure a stable and comfortable ride. The integrated handlebar lights ensure you're always clearly visible in city traffic. The a-LANE ENERGY is the ideal choice for daily commutes with a focus on efficiency and sustainability.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands.\nPlease note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
